From 25875eb000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Loukious <loukious@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] wifi: Add FEATURE_FRAME_INJECTION_SUPPORT for qcacld-3.0

Adapted from Loukious@65c6a05e (android_kernel_xiaomi_sm8150).
Enables frame injection on Qualcomm QCACLD-3.0 Wi-Fi drivers by:
- Adding CONFIG_FEATURE_FRAME_INJECTION_SUPPORT Kbuild option
- Creating hidden STA vdev to bypass firmware vdev type check
- Rewriting vdev_id in WMI TX path for monitor interface frames
- Adding frame validation and security checks for injected frames

Ponytail: stripped test/debug/unit-test files; only production code paths
kept. Full test suite available upstream if needed later.

Signed-off-by: NetHunter Build <nethunter@local>
